[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_01_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_01_0010","text":"————哦\n果穗，今天又来了啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_01_0020","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_01_0030","text":"那个，今天……\n不用了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_01_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_01_0040","text":"……诶？\n真少见啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_01_0050","text":"啊……\n那个————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_01_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_01_0052","text":"摄影导演"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_01_0060","text":"大小姐啊……倒也说不上什么诀窍，\n平时就开始在脑海里想象那种感觉可能会比较好哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_01_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_01_0070","text":"……\n我想趁现在先把心情准备好……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_01_0080","text":"啊，是下次拍摄的……\n确实，先确定好角色的形象是很重要的事"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_01_0090","text":"因为要比现在更成熟才行……\n平时的我就先封印起来了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_01_0100","text":"哈哈，是吗\n不要太勉强自己哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30900400_01_0101","text":"Motion"}]
